# MISSION 11 - VARGA'S LAST DEAL
# The rival gang leader's link to the alien technology plot. Two choices with consequences.
mission 11
key m11
title "Varga's Last Deal"
desc "With the city burning, Black Lantern is cleaning up everyone who ever touched a Shard. Nikolai Varga is next on their list - and he knows who bought his Halberd shipments."
start mansion 0 0
requires 10
reward 2000

music combat
spawn varga story varga @mansion 2 -30 180 varga magnum cower
name varga "Nikolai Varga"
invulnerable varga 1
spawn vdead gunman varga_thug @mansion -6 -12 0 varga smg stand
spawn vdead gunman varga_thug @mansion 7 -20 0 varga smg stand
slay vdead
group ops operative operative 5 @mansion 0 -16 6 operatives rifle hostile
name ops "Black Lantern Operative"
goto @mansion 0 -3 5 "Get through the estate gate"
kill ops "Kill the Black Lantern team"
group ops2 operative operative 4 @mansion -9 -27 3 operatives rifle hostile
name ops2 "Black Lantern Operative"
say operative "Second team moving in! Get Varga!"
kill ops2 "Kill the second team"
checkpoint
music tension
goto_actor varga 2.5 "Reach Varga"
dialogue m11_varga
choice "Varga is bleeding out on his own lawn." "Let him live" spare "Finish him" execute
label spare
dialogue m11_spare
flag varga_spared 1
rep varga 30
jump marcus
label execute
invulnerable varga 0
hostile varga
kill varga "Finish Varga"
dialogue m11_execute
flag varga_spared 0
rep varga -50
label marcus
checkpoint
spawn marcus story marcus @diner 2 8 200 civilian fists stand
name marcus "Marcus Reyes"
invulnerable marcus 1
goto @diner 0 -1 4 "Find Marcus at the Lucky Star Diner"
talk marcus "Confront [E]" "Confront Marcus"
dialogue m11_marcus
choice "Marcus sold Eli out to save his own family." "Forgive him" forgive "Walk away from him for good" leave
label forgive
dialogue m11_forgive
flag marcus_forgiven 1
jump done
label leave
dialogue m11_leave
flag marcus_forgiven 0
label done
end
